{"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 6, "reposts": 1, "likes": 54, "bookmarks": 2, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 21:59:42 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769723982, "views": 7474, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2016967019787358423", "id": "2016967019787358423", "text": "I wrote the first half of the game play by hand.  I wrote the second half with grok, which did an OK job.  Then I started writing the computer strategy with Claude.  I've been working on that for nearly two weeks (off and on).  I've reverted the attempt twice.  \n\nFinally I'm having Claude implement the strategy written in C in the '80s.  \n\nLesson:  Implementing a strategy written for a resource constrained environment (VMS in the 80s in C) seems to be something Claude can do without getting into a Myopia loop.", "raw_text": {"text": "I wrote the first half of the game play by hand.  I wrote the second half with grok, which did an OK job.  Then I started writing the computer strategy with Claude.  I've been working on that for nearly two weeks (off and on).  I've reverted the attempt twice.  \n\nFinally I'm having Claude implement the strategy written in C in the '80s.  \n\nLesson:  Implementing a strategy written for a resource constrained environment (VMS in the 80s in C) seems to be something Claude can do without getting into a Myopia loop.", "display_text_range": [0, 515], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 7, "reposts": 1, "likes": 137, "bookmarks": 24, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 20:09:45 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769717385, "views": 22046, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2016966303127339112", "id": "2016966303127339112", "text": "Whenever I see a misbehavior, I ask Claude what the VMS solution did.  It tells me.  Then I say: \"Do that\".  And it does.  So I guess Claude can translate C to Clojure in small increments.", "raw_text": {"text": "Whenever I see a misbehavior, I ask Claude what the VMS solution did.  It tells me.  Then I say: \"Do that\".  And it does.  So I guess Claude can translate C to Clojure in small increments.", "display_text_range": [0, 188