", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 3, "reposts": 0, "likes": 54, "bookmarks": 6, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 19:12:10 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769713930, "views": 11483, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2016946251678257470", "id": "2016946251678257470", "text": "constantly having to remind Claude of things we discussed a half an hour ago is frustrating.  Piling all these tidbits up in a claude md is frustrating.", "raw_text": {"text": "constantly having to remind Claude of things we discussed a half an hour ago is frustrating.  Piling all these tidbits up in a claude md is frustrating.", "display_text_range": [0, 152], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 121, "reposts": 10, "likes": 459, "bookmarks": 40, "quotes": 8, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 18:47:14 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769712434, "views": 45587, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2016942994797035961", "id": "2016942994797035961", "text": "There is something soulless about staring at Claude windows and hoping against hope that -- this time -- it will be right.  The agents are sucking away my own agency.", "raw_text": {"text": "There is something soulless about staring at Claude windows and hoping against hope that -- this time -- it will be right.  The agents are sucking away my own agency.", "display_text_range": [0, 166], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 89, "reposts": 21, "likes": 760, "bookmarks": 67, "quotes": 13, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 18:34:17 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769711657, "views": 46906, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2016941144374948283", "id": "2016941144374948283", "text": "I'm back down to one agent, feeling my way.  Frustrating.", "raw_text": {"text": "I'm back down to one agent, feeling my way.  Frustrating.", "display_text_range": [0, 57], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 20, "reposts": 0, "likes": 134, "bookmarks": 6, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 18:26:56 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769711216, "views": 17014, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2016940475131801834", "id": "2016940475131801834", "text": "Walter Bright wrote this code in C for VMS in the '80s.  I'm having Claude look at that code and try to integrate his solution into my game.  It's not going very well so far; but I have hope.  \n\nWalter's solution is simplistic but elegant.  A lot better than my attempts.  We'll see.", "raw_text": {"text": "Walter Bright wrote this code in C for VMS in the '80s.  I'm having Claude look at that code and try to integrate his solution into my game.  It's not going very well so far; but I have hope.  \n\nWalter's solution is simplistic but elegant.  A lot better than my attempts.  We'll see.", "display_text_range": [0, 283], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 3, "reposts": 1, "likes": 42, "bookmarks": 6, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 18:24:16 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769711056, "views": 10004, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2016891380690309398", "id": "2016891380690309398", "text": "So my first strategy (a week ago) was to have each unit in the game decide its best next move.  This wound up with me piling one rule on top of another into a self-contradictory mess.  \n\nSo last weekend I adopted the strategy of having hierarchical finite state machines: A general, some lieutenants, and individual units.  Each fsm is a simple mission to perform.  Missions are assigned down through the hierarchy.\n\nAt first this looked like it was going to work.  But how we're back to piling one contradictory rule on top of another.  \n\nI need a new plan.  Time to go for a walk.", "raw_text": {"text": "So my first strategy (a week ago) was to have each unit in the game decide its best next move.  This wound up with me piling one rule on top of another into a self-contradictory mess.  \n\nSo last weekend I adopted the strategy of having hierarchical finite state machines: A general, some lieutenants, and individual units.  Each fsm is a simple mission to perform.  Missions are assigned down through the hierarchy.\n\nAt first this looked like it was going to work.  But how we're back to piling one contradictory rule on top of another.  \n\nI need a new plan.  Time to go for a walk.", "display_text_range": [0, 582], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 17, "reposts": 1, "likes": 77, "bookmarks": 13, "quotes": 1, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Jan 29 15:09:11 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1769699351, "views": 11423, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}], "cursor": {"top": "DAAHCgABHTeMnXvAI7cLAAIAAAATMjAxNzM1OTAzMDIxNDA5OTIyMggAAwAAAAEAAA", "bottom": "DAAHCgABHTeMnXu__